title: "Resilient Logistics under Burst Disruptions: generator, dominance filter, and recorded result manifests"
abstract: >-
  Code, brute-force checks and recorded results for the manuscript "Outage
  scenarios that suffice for two-stage and multi-stage robust capacity design",
  together with the material of version 1 (scenario generator, dominance
  preprocessing, solver drivers and recorded result manifests of an earlier
  manuscript on the same cislunar instance).
